{"id": "lib/compute/findings.dart:offset-3723", "file": "lib/compute/findings.dart", "location": "offset-3723", "text": "'Sustained rise vs your baseline — a possible illness signal.'", "sha256": "683aa412b9c35b3582a540a10f828221a718a825f52171e355e8e82f96585584", "kind": "dart", "start": 3723, "end": 3785, "line": 88}
{"id": "lib/compute/findings.dart:offset-3836", "file": "lib/compute/findings.dart", "location": "offset-3836", "text": "'Your beat-to-beat pattern looked irregular today. This is a '\n'screen, not a diagnosis — see a clinician if you have symptoms.'", "sha256": "e16419e2e152be1b89be762013b194718d9685f4c186f720b44072df3404a24e", "kind": "dart", "start": 3836, "end": 3978, "line": 90}
{"id": "lib/compute/findings.dart:offset-4026", "file": "lib/compute/findings.dart", "location": "offset-4026", "text": "'Your recovery markers are below your usual range — ease off.'", "sha256": "19db9df13aa4788d59401333063b59202fab9084933ccc2bd2e487609b117be7", "kind": "dart", "start": 4026, "end": 4088, "line": 93}
{"id": "lib/compute/findings.dart:offset-4132", "file": "lib/compute/findings.dart", "location": "offset-4132", "text": "'Your resting HR has ${risen == false ? '", "sha256": "8ff6afb648251fd5b11fba328c2d9809f04f154039f2137d7884ae65af2ff6fa", "kind": "dart", "start": 4132, "end": 4173, "line": 95}
{"id": "lib/compute/findings.dart:offset-4189", "file": "lib/compute/findings.dart", "location": "offset-4189", "text": "'} '\n'noticeably versus your recent baseline.'", "sha256": "e6c8e449cbef78e641e1edea7c8ad299145f609d164c6ef900e113c78c933c6b", "kind": "dart", "start": 4189, "end": 4249, "line": 95}
