{"id": "lib/compute/manual_session.dart:offset-3116", "file": "lib/compute/manual_session.dart", "location": "offset-3116", "text": "'The end time has to be after the start time.'", "sha256": "e04a441c668884e55009eeb672780796cc33308ed73837c1689de5fccbc5c7c5", "kind": "dart", "start": 3116, "end": 3162, "line": 69}
