{"id": "lib/compute/onehz_pipeline.dart:offset-21975", "file": "lib/compute/onehz_pipeline.dart", "location": "offset-21975", "text": "'no sleep was scored for this day — resting HR is only ever '\n'measured over a sleep window, never over waking hours'", "sha256": "8dcb910b94bdaed8eca2e2af694b88b46e7349e3a3665187c095407a9b11041e", "kind": "dart", "start": 21975, "end": 22106, "line": 449}
{"id": "lib/compute/onehz_pipeline.dart:offset-25556", "file": "lib/compute/onehz_pipeline.dart", "location": "offset-25556", "text": "'refused: the red and IR channels are one signal — '\n'ir − red is a fixed offset within a session, so any ratio built from '\n'them measures baseline drift, not oxygenation'", "sha256": "54489c288de25176678ab11e040f6ab232620fbed77cffdcb68e4d5e4ac5980e", "kind": "dart", "start": 25556, "end": 25740, "line": 519}
